  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "He meets Fang Yuan burning in flames and asks whether Fang Yuan came from Yi Tian Mountain. His attitude is not friendly. Even though he is a lone cultivator, he has already joined Southern Border’s Chai clan. After Chai clan Gu Immortals died in the battle of Yi Tian Mountain, Chai clan’s first supreme elder sent this external elder to investigate the cause. Taking Fang Yuan for an old friend of Chai clan’s ninth elder rather than suspecting his true identity, he lends him mortal Gu worms at his request.",
      "chapters": [
        1024
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_yi_tian_mountain",
        "reg_southern_border",
        "fac_chai_clan",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When he appears, he is burning in flames.",
      "chapters": [
        1024
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Later he uses a Gu that covers his body in flames less than a human finger long.",
      "chapters": [
        1025
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan meets him while holding three Immortal Gu and some soul path and dream path mortal Gu, still at a disadvantage if they fought. Fang Yuan deceives him with attitude Gu so the acting seems flawless and Huo Kong Dong feels Fang Yuan is enraged and does not want to provoke him. Using this acting, Fang Yuan also scams four rank five mortal Gu from him.",
      "chapters": [
        1025
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "attitude-gu-meeting",
